    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region leads with $725K sales, outperforming South by 85%
        • East region strong at $679K, only $46K behind West
        • South significantly underperforms at $392K (54% of West's volume)
        • Clear regional performance gap with $334K difference between top and bottom regions

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate South region's underperformance and implement West's successful strategies
        • Maintain momentum in West and East with continued investment
        • Analyze Central region's mid-tier performance for optimization opportunities
